that's good enough. Gotta prioritize ensuring every villager makes it out of the night."},{"t":"cmd","c":"character","a":{"name":"char_362_Saga#3"}},{"t":"line","name":"Saga","text":"Ho, quite the profound rapport. My horizons do broaden."},{"t":"cmd","c":"dialog","a":{}},{"t":"cmd","c":"character","a":{}},{"t":"cmd","c":"delay","a":{"time":0.6}},{"t":"cmd","c":"character","a":{"name":"avg_npc_142#1"}},{"t":"cmd","c":"camerashake","a":{"duration":0.3,"xstrength":30,"ystrength":30,"vibrato":30,"randomness":90,"fadeout":true,"block":true}},{"t":"line","name":"Little Girl","text":"Wahhh... uwh-uwaah..."},{"t":"cmd","c":"character","a":{"name":"char_455_nothing_1#3","name2":"char_1011_purgatory_1#1","focus":1}},{"t":"line","name":"Mr. Nothing","text":"B—But how do we bring this young girl with us?"},{"t":"cmd","c":"character","a":{"name":"char_455_nothing_1#3","name2":"char_1011_purgatory_1#4","focus":2}},{"t":"line","name":"Lava","text":"You take her out of here, and to somewhere safe. Okay?"},{"t":"cmd","c":"character","a":{"name":"char_455_nothing_1#6","name2":"char_1011_purgatory_1#4","focus":1}},{"t":"cmd","c":"camerashake","a":{"duration":0.5,"xstrength":30,"ystrength":30,"vibrato":30,"randomness":90,"fadeout":true,"block":false}},{"t":"cmd","c":"characteraction","a":{"name":"left","type":"jump","power":40,"fadetime":0.5,"times":1,"block":true}},{"t":"line","name":"Mr. Nothing","text":"Verily! As if I couldn't!"},{"t":"cmd","c":"dialog","a":{}},{"t":"cmd","c":"delay","a":{"time":0.6}},{"t":"cmd","c":"character","a":{"name":"char_455_nothing_1#3","name2":"char_1011_purgatory_1#4","focus":1}},{"t":"cmd","c":"characteraction","a":{"name":"left","type":"move","xpos":100,"fadetime":0.6,"block":true}},{"t":"line","name":"Mr. Nothing","text":"However—I really cannot bear to cast off my benefactors and take refuge alone! The fact I cannot accompany my benefactors in lopping off heads and spilling fresh blood is a true shame—"},{"t":"cmd","c":"delay","a":{"time":0.6}},{"t"